@startuml T-餐厨与扩展
' 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 L3 · T 餐厨与扩展（UC-SUB-T-17 ~ T-21）
title 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 · T 餐厨与扩展
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "产废单位" as WASTEUNIT
actor "收运企业" as COLLECTOR
actor "供应商" as SUPPLIER
actor "采购方" as BUYER
actor "消费者" as CONSUMER
actor "平台运营方" as OPER

rectangle "T 餐厨与扩展" {
  usecase "UC-SUB-T-17 登记餐厨垃圾去向" as T17
  usecase "UC-SUB-T-18 建立收运企业信用档案" as T18
  usecase "UC-SUB-T-19 配置扩展品类资质门槛" as T19
  usecase "UC-SUB-T-20 消费者选购并扫码验真" as T20
  usecase "UC-SUB-T-21 辅助采购决策" as T21
}

WASTEUNIT --> T17
COLLECTOR --> T17
COLLECTOR --> T18
SUPPLIER --> T19
CONSUMER --> T20
BUYER --> T21

note bottom of T17
  产废登记→白名单收运扫码交接→处理厂接收，全链留痕
end note
note bottom of T20
  平台定位 B2B 为主、B2C 为延伸（细节待确认）
end note
note bottom of T21
  只撮合不代下单/不代定价；衔接担保下单（T-11）
end note
@enduml
